{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shattered Bride</i></strong> is a fast-paced 3D platformer set in the haunting underground world of <strong>Cavere</strong>, where gothic cities stretch across the walls of colossal caves and a pale, unnatural glow casts long shadows. You play as <strong>Aurelia</strong>, a fox-like demon on a desperate mission to recover the shattered body of her bride, <strong>Korine</strong>, torn apart in a ritual by the Gopherfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse sprawling, vertical levels using fluid movement mechanics like <strong>wallriding</strong>, <strong>sliding</strong>, and <strong>double jumping</strong>. Strategically place <strong>checkpoints</strong> to master challenging segments, but beware\u2014everything dies in one hit, even you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four unique districts, uncover hidden lore, and slowly piece together a story that twists your understanding of good and evil. <i>Shattered Bride</i> is not just a test of skill, but a descent into love, vengeance, and the rebirth of something ancient and unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not salvation. This is devotion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565320?t=1749830586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565320/adb472ecf82df43c9302ef26dbe63edce093723f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749830586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565320/83b49459522fdc2a3027ceb0cfedbebfeac2e98e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749830586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565320/83b49459522fdc2a3027ceb0cfedbebfeac2e98e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749830586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes combat that displays dying as a spray of blood,  killing an enemy displays a splatter of blood on the screen and small lore note about cheating in a relationship."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shattered Bride</i></strong> is a fast-paced 3D platformer set in the haunting underground world of <strong>Cavere</strong>, where gothic cities stretch across the walls of colossal caves and a pale, unnatural glow casts long shadows. You play as <strong>Aurelia</strong>, a fox-like demon on a desperate mission to recover the shattered body of her bride, <strong>Korine</strong>, torn apart in a ritual by the Gopherfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse sprawling, vertical levels using fluid movement mechanics like <strong>wallriding</strong>, <strong>sliding</strong>, and <strong>double jumping</strong>. Strategically place <strong>checkpoints</strong> to master challenging segments, but beware\u2014everything dies in one hit, even you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four unique districts, uncover hidden lore, and slowly piece together a story that twists your understanding of good and evil. <i>Shattered Bride</i> is not just a test of skill, but a descent into love, vengeance, and the rebirth of something ancient and unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not salvation. This is devotion.</p>","developers":["Need More Bullets"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565320/d3baeb7bdb4035a33461540bb8fb2cc0ec8640e1/header.jpg?t=1749830586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565320/1043406021/bd9ff1c0788e7d9763c935e9f926d3869bcaaeab/1750839893/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747085913","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565320/1043406021/bd9ff1c0788e7d9763c935e9f926d3869bcaaeab/1750839893/dash_h264.mpd?t=